      "content": "wait so you're saying Georgian Dream is basically the \"bad\" side because of authoritarianism, but the UNM is also bad because they're violent? that seems like a bit of a wash lol. if i'm trying to find the \"good\" or legitimate voices that actually represent the people's will without all the drama, why are the Free Democrats the only ones you'd call moderate? isn't there more nuance to it than just picking a small third party?",
